    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996680/extras/2a3f7841befa2ad10939c4c2028e8338.avif?t=1719647572\" /></div><br>A mysterious disease is turning people into vicious abominations. As part of Plague Birds Guild you are selected as the new field contractor and forced to abandon your research. You'll have to figure out why you've been picked for this role while surviving your new job of exterminating infected patients.<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- Dark Gothic Aesthetic<br>- Fast Paced Combat<br>- Immersive  Soundscapes<br>- Analog Directional Attacks<br>- Plague Doctors<br>- Two &quot;D&quot; Rank Bosses<br>- Secret Hard Modes<br>- Upgrades<br>- Partial Controller Support<br>- Breakable Props<br>- Unimaginably Painful Medical Procedures<br>- Leeches<br><br>UPCOMING FEATURES:<br>- More Bosses<br>- More Characters<br>- More Weapons<br>- More Upgrades<br>- Weapon Upgrades<br>- More Secrets<br>- More Abilities<br>- Hard and Challenge Modes<br>- Full Controller Support<br>- More Areas<br>- Guild Overhaul and Expansion<br>- More Music<br>- Phobias<br>- Fixes and Adjustments to Art and Gameplay<br>- More Leeches!!!",
